              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "Seil the Veil (Psychic Level 1)",
            "id": "b682-cbe5-8b92-6464",
            "hidden": false,
            "typeId": "7e03-38c2-7fea-e955",
            "typeName": "Psychic Abilities",
            "characteristics": [
              {
                "name": "Descriptions",
                "$text": "In your command phase if this model is not **battle-shocked** you can select 1 **enemy** unit with the **Daemonic** and/or **corrupt** keywords. You can reduce the **selected** units **toughness** and **strength** on its **melee** weapons by 1 or take a **psychic roll** on 1D6.\n:\n- On a 1: This unit is **battle-shocked**\n- Else: The **selected** unit is **battle-shocked** and has -1 to its **toughness** and **strength** on its **melee** weapons",
