            "typeName": "Psychic Abilities",
            "characteristics": [
              {
                "name": "Descriptions",
                "$text": "In your **shooting** phase this model can use this ability instead of shooting if this unit is not **battle-shocked**.\nYou can target 1 **enemy** unit withing 36\" and withing **line of sight** of this model then roll 6D6. Then count up each 4+. The **targeted** unit then must take a **leadership test** minus the number of 4+ you made. If the **targeted** unit fails it becomes **pinned**.",
